{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/046-qiang-you-ci/chenhuan-chuanshu","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/046-qiang-you-ci/chenhuan-chuanshu/data.json","title":"詩毛氏傳疏 · 牆有茨 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 鄘風 · 牆有茨 · 汇集《詩毛氏傳疏》关于《牆有茨》的 2 条注释，含 2 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"046-qiang-you-ci","materialId":"chenhuan-chuanshu"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/046-qiang-you-ci/chenhuan-chuanshu","poem":{"id":"046-qiang-you-ci","title":"牆有茨","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"yongfeng","path":["風","鄘風","牆有茨"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"牆有茨","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"不可埽也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"中冓之言","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"不可道也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"所可道也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"言之醜也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"牆有茨","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"不可襄也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"中冓之言","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"不可詳也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"所可詳也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"言之長也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-013","text":"牆有茨","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-014","text":"不可束也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-015","text":"中冓之言","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-016","text":"不可讀也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-017","text":"所可讀也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-018","text":"言之辱也","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"chenhuan-chuanshu","title":"詩毛氏傳疏","authors":["陳奐"],"contributorLine":"清 · 陳奐","era":"清","publicationYear":1847,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":2,"glossCount":2},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":2,"layer":"preface","layerLabel":"篇序","targetText":"牆有茨衛人刺上也公子頑通乎君母國人疾之而不可道也","targetNotes":"篇首小序。","sourceLabel":"第 2 页","sourceNotes":"卷四页二左栏篇首序文。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"诗序","sectionLabel":"序","text":"序：《牆有茨》，衛人刺上也。公子頑通乎君母，國人疾之而不可道也。","notes":null}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":2,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"牆有茨，不可埽也。中冓之言，不可道也。所可道也，言之醜也。牆有茨，不可襄也。中冓之言，不可詳也。所可詳也，言之長也。牆有茨，不可束也。中冓之言，不可讀也。所可讀也，言之辱也。","targetNotes":"通篇经传疏解。","sourceLabel":"第 2-3 页","sourceNotes":"据卷四页二至页三《牆有茨》经传疏。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"陈奂","sectionLabel":"疏","text":"陈奂疏《牆有茨》时，先依《序》“公子頑通乎君母，國人疾之而不可道也”申明刺意在宣姜與公子頑淫亂，不可稱說。其释首章“牆有茨，不可埽也”“中冓之言，不可道也”“所可道也，言之醜也”，以牆茨難埽喻宫闈醜行難以發露，而一經稱道即成醜聞。次章“牆有茨，不可襄也”“中冓之言，不可詳也”“所可詳也，言之長也”，谓穢事繁衍，不可詳陳；若詳陳之，醜語牽引而滋長。末章“牆有茨，不可束也”“中冓之言，不可讀也”“所可讀也，言之辱也”，则言其事不可收拾，尤不堪宣讀；讀之於人，終歸於辱。","notes":null}]}]}}}
